 loves pizza.  We can go to dinner there.", "time": "7500"}, {"image": "engenn2le06ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>:        Great idea. You can see what it is like.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Do you want to come with us?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>:        Uh-huh, I'll bring John too!", "time": "17750"}, {"image": "engenn2le06ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Plus, they have a special package deal on Saturdays: 2 for 1 pizzas and free ice cream!<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>:        Good to know! Actually ... do you want to go in and check it out? I'm really hungry.", "time": "24500"}, {"image": "engenn2le06ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 5, "text": "<span class = \"strong\">Clerk</span>:        Welcome to Pizzario. Can I take your order?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>:        I'll have the special package deal. Vanessa, what are you having?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>:       Two pizzas? Hmm. I'll have some of yours.", "time": "40000"}], "coverimg": "engenn2le06ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What is a flyer?</span>", "time": "5000"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\"> When do you use a flyer?</span>", "time": "54400"}, {"image": "", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">How do you make a flyer? </span>", "time": "69200"}], "video_src": "engenn2le06ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Where are the best places to go for dinner in you